    <item>
      <title>超越GPU，掘金AI算力盲区：MLPerf Storage v2.0揭示存储基建的深层博弈</title>
      <link>http://192.168.50.247:1313/insights/gpuaimlperf-storage-v20-20251027104004774-0/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 27 Oct 2025 10:40:04 +0800</pubDate>
